<title>UK: PGA buys 50 pct stake in Woburn golf courses.</title>
<headline>PGA buys 50 pct stake in Woburn golf courses.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Golf course owner and operator PGA European Tour Courses Plc said on Friday that it has agreed with Bedford Estates to buy a 50 percent stake in Woburn Golf and Country Club Ltd.</p>
<p>It will pay up to 5.75 million stg in cash for the shares which are being bought partly through an acquisition of existing shares and through a subscription of new shares.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
